    "type": "GeoProperty",
      "type": "LineString"
  "type": "T"


04. Append a NEW untyped GeoProperty - no stored type to lean on
===============================================================
HTTP/1.1 204 No Content
  "spot": {
    "type": "GeoProperty",
    "value": {
      "coordinates": [
        9,
        9


05. Replace the whole Entity with an untyped GeoProperty
=======================================================
HTTP/1.1 204 No Content
HTTP/1.1 200 OK
